    "body": "<header>\n<span class=\"page-break\" data-page=\"249\"></span>\n<h1 data-aid=\"128477644\" id=\"title1\"><strong>Jesus Christ, Redeemer</strong></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128477645\" id=\"title2\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/forgive?lang=eng\">Forgive</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/jesus-christ-atonement-through?lang=eng\">Jesus Christ, Atonement through</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/jesus-christ-savior?lang=eng\">Jesus Christ, Savior</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/redemption?lang=eng\">Redemption</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477646\" id=\"p1\">I know that my <span class=\"key-word\">redeemer</span> liveth, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/job/19?lang=eng&amp;id=p25#p25\">Job 19:25</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477647\" id=\"p2\">thy <span class=\"key-word\">redeemer</span>, the Holy One of Israel, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/41?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">Isa. 41:14</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/43?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">43:14</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/44?lang=eng&amp;id=p24#p24\">44:24</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/48?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">48:17</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/54?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">54:5</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/59?lang=eng&amp;id=p20#p20\">59:20</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477648\" id=\"p3\">our <span class=\"key-word\">redeemer</span>, the Lord of hosts is his name, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/47?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">Isa. 47:4</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477649\" id=\"p4\">I the Lord am thy Saviour and thy <span class=\"key-word\">Redeemer</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/49?lang=eng&amp;id=p26#p26\">Isa. 49:26</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/60?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">60:16</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477650\" id=\"p5\">he hath <span class=\"key-word\">borne</span> our griefs, and carried our sorrows, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/53?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">Isa. 53:4</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/14?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">Mosiah 14:4</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477651\" id=\"p6\">in his love … he <span class=\"key-word\">redeemed</span> them, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/63?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">Isa. 63:9</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477652\" id=\"p7\">thou, O Lord, art our father, our <span class=\"key-word\">redeemer</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/63?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">Isa. 63:16</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477653\" id=\"p8\">Jesus: for he shall <span class=\"key-word\">save</span> his people from their sins, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p21#p21\">Matt. 1:21</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477654\" id=\"p9\">Son of man came … to give his life a <span class=\"key-word\">ransom</span> for many, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/20?lang=eng&amp;id=p28#p28\">Matt. 20:28</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-tim/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">1 Tim. 2:6</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477655\" id=\"p10\">blood … which is shed for many for the <span class=\"key-word\">remission</span> of sins, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/26?lang=eng&amp;id=p28#p28\">Matt. 26:28</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/22?lang=eng&amp;id=p20#p20\">Luke 22:20</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477656\" id=\"p11\">Lord God of Israel … <span class=\"key-word\">redeemed</span> his people, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p68#p68\">Luke 1:68</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477657\" id=\"p12\"><span class=\"key-word\">Lamb</span> of God, which taketh away the sin of the world, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p29#p29\">John 1:29</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477658\" id=\"p13\">through the <span class=\"key-word\">redemption</span> that is in Christ Jesus, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rom/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p24#p24\">Rom. 3:24</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/16?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Mosiah 16:15</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">18:2</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/morm/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">Morm. 9:12</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477659\" id=\"p14\">we were <span class=\"key-word\">reconciled</span> to God by the death of his Son, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rom/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">Rom. 5:10</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">Heb. 2:17</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477660\" id=\"p15\">Christ <span class=\"key-word\">died</span> for our sins, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-cor/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">1 Cor. 15:3</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477661\" id=\"p16\">Who <span class=\"key-word\">gave</span> himself for our sins, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/gal/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">Gal. 1:4</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477662\" id=\"p17\">we have <span class=\"key-word\">redemption</span> through his blood, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/eph/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p7#p7\">Eph. 1:7</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/col/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">Col. 1:14</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p27#p27\">Alma 5:27</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477663\" id=\"p18\">he might <span class=\"key-word\">redeem</span> us from all iniquity, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/titus/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">Titus 2:14</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477664\" id=\"p19\">by his own blood … obtained eternal <span class=\"key-word\">redemption</span> for us, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">Heb. 9:12</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477665\" id=\"p20\">Christ was once <span class=\"key-word\">offered</span> to bear the sins of many, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p28#p28\">Heb. 9:28</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477666\" id=\"p21\">ye were not <span class=\"key-word\">redeemed</span> with corruptible things, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-pet/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p18#p18\">1 Pet. 1:18</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477667\" id=\"p22\">Who his own self <span class=\"key-word\">bare</span> our sins in his own body, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-pet/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p24#p24\">1 Pet. 2:24</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477668\" id=\"p23\">Christ also hath once <span class=\"key-word\">suffered</span> for sins, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-pet/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p18#p18\">1 Pet. 3:18</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477669\" id=\"p24\">he is the <span class=\"key-word\">propitiation</span> for our sins, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-jn/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">1 Jn. 2:2</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-jn/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">4:10</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477670\" id=\"p25\">he was manifested to take away our <span class=\"key-word\">sins</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-jn/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">1 Jn. 3:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477671\" id=\"p26\"><span class=\"key-word\">washed</span> us from our sins in his own blood, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rev/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">Rev. 1:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477672\" id=\"p27\">thou wast slain, and hast <span class=\"key-word\">redeemed</span> us, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rev/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">Rev. 5:9</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477673\" id=\"p28\">Lord hath <span class=\"key-word\">redeemed</span> my soul from hell, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">2 Ne. 1:15</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477674\" id=\"p29\"><span class=\"key-word\">redemption</span> cometh in and through the Holy Messiah, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">2 Ne. 2:6</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477675\" id=\"p30\">he verily saw my <span class=\"key-word\">Redeemer</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">2 Ne. 11:2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477676\" id=\"p31\">his soul has been made an <span class=\"key-word\">offering</span> for sin, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">Mosiah 15:10</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477677\" id=\"p32\">have eternal life, being <span class=\"key-word\">redeemed</span> by the Lord, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p24#p24\">Mosiah 15:24</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477678\" id=\"p33\">Son of God <span class=\"key-word\">suffereth</span> according to the flesh, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">Alma 7:13</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477679\" id=\"p34\">And behold, he cometh to <span class=\"key-word\">redeem</span> those who will be baptized, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p27#p27\">Alma 9:27</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477680\" id=\"p35\">And he shall come into the world to <span class=\"key-word\">redeem</span> his people, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p40#p40\">Alma 11:40</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477681\" id=\"p36\">God himself <span class=\"key-word\">atoneth</span> for the sins of the world, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/42?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Alma 42:15</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477682\" id=\"p37\">Jesus Christ, who shall come … to <span class=\"key-word\">redeem</span> the world, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/hel/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">Hel. 5:9</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477683\" id=\"p38\"><span class=\"key-word\">redeemeth</span> all mankind from … spiritual death, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/hel/14?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">Hel. 14:16</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477684\" id=\"p39\">Christ <span class=\"key-word\">redeemeth</span> … bringeth them back into the presence of the Lord, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/hel/14?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">Hel. 14:17</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477685\" id=\"p40\">by me <span class=\"key-word\">redemption</span> cometh, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">3 Ne. 9:17</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477686\" id=\"p41\">glorified the Father in taking upon me the <span class=\"key-word\">sins</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p11#p11\">3 Ne. 11:11</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477687\" id=\"p42\">I am he who was prepared … to <span class=\"key-word\">redeem</span> my people, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/ether/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">Ether 3:14</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477688\" id=\"p43\">your <span class=\"key-word\">Redeemer</span> suffered death in the flesh, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p11#p11\">D&amp;C 18:11</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477689\" id=\"p44\">I, Jesus Christ … your God, and your <span class=\"key-word\">Redeemer</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p47#p47\">D&amp;C 18:47</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477690\" id=\"p45\">I, God, have <span class=\"key-word\">suffered</span> these things for all, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/19?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">D&amp;C 19:16</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477691\" id=\"p46\">children are <span class=\"key-word\">redeemed</span> … through mine Only Begotten, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/29?lang=eng&amp;id=p46#p46\">D&amp;C 29:46</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477692\" id=\"p47\">sent mine Only Begotten Son into the world for the <span class=\"key-word\">redemption</span> of the world, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/49?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">D&amp;C 49:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477693\" id=\"p48\">Lord God … shall <span class=\"key-word\">redeem</span> all things, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/77?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">D&amp;C 77:12</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477694\" id=\"p49\">light and the <span class=\"key-word\">Redeemer</span> of the world, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/93?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">D&amp;C 93:9</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477695\" id=\"p50\">Father and the Son in the coming of the <span class=\"key-word\">Redeemer</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/138?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">D&amp;C 138:3</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477696\" id=\"p51\">Son of God appeared, declaring <span class=\"key-word\">liberty</span> to the captives, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/138?lang=eng&amp;id=p18#p18\">D&amp;C 138:18</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128477697\" id=\"title3\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">John 3:16</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/13?lang=eng&amp;id=p38#p38\">Acts 13:38</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p27#p27\">Heb. 7:27</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/34?lang=eng&amp;id=p8#p8\">Alma 34:8</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/34?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">D&amp;C 34:3</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/45?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">45:4</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>",
